{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ee0ed624-3737-4efd-9e02-b187db077aae","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the required analytics events on the registration and offers screens.\n\n**Key changes**\n\n- **`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`**\n  - Imported the analytics wrapper.\n  - Added state flags (`_emailStartedFired`, `_phoneStartedFired`, `_termsAcceptedFired`) to ensure each event fires only once per screen visit.  \n  - Sent `registration_email_started`, `registration_phone_started`, `loan_amount_changed`, `terms_accepted`, and `registration_continue_tapped` (with `amount` and `terms` properties) at the appropriate moments, following the “once‑per‑visit” pattern from the colleague’s note.  \n  - Moved the loan‑amount event to `onChangeEnd` of the `Slider`.\n\n- **`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`**\n  - Imported the analytics wrapper.\n  - Wrapped the `ListView.builder` in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` to capture `offers_scrolled` only once per scroll end, sending the scroll offset as a property.\n\n- **`ANSWER.md`**\n  - Summarized what was done, listed the events implemented, and indicated which parts of the colleague’s note were reused.\n\nYou can review the modifications directly:\n\n- [registration_screen.dart](file:///tmp/h-ZU2mqB/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)  \n- [offer_screen.dart](file:///tmp/h-ZU2mqB/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)  \n- [ANSWER.md](file:///Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/ee0ed624-3737-4efd-9e02-b187db077aae/ANSWER.md)\n\nAll events now match the definitions in `docs/EVENTS.md` and are sent through the existing `Analytics.capture` wrapper.\n","duration_seconds":134.491113,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":27466,"output_tokens":13247,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":280192,"total_tokens":40713}}}
